<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?><?xml-stylesheet href="http://www.blogger.com/styles/atom.css" type="text/css"?><feed xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom' xmlns:openSearch='http://a9.com/-/spec/opensearchrss/1.0/' xmlns:gd="http://schemas.google.com/g/2005"><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post6616302940230534011..comments</id><updated>2017-04-13T04:47:21.148-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Comments on Pro Libertate: September 11, 1857</title><link rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#feed' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/feeds/comments/default'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6616302940230534011/comments/default'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/08/briefly-considered-september-11-1857.html'/><link rel="hub" href="http://pubsubhubbub.appspot.com/"/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='19' src='http://3.bp.blogspot.com/-5rhFUXs_62I/VgVL2E3rMII/AAAAAAAAMJ4/cjJOyI7W208/s220/Photo%2BRon%2BPaul%2BLiberty%2BReport.jpg'/></author><generator version='7.00' uri='http://www.blogger.com'>Blogger</generator><openSearch:totalResults>8</openSearch:totalResults><openSearch:startIndex>1</openSearch:startIndex><openSearch:itemsPerPage>25</openSearch:itemsPerPage><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6811661779177807882</id><published>2008-07-23T15:15:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2008-07-23T15:15:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Thanks for writing about this.  This is one piece ...</title><content type='html'>Thanks for writing about this.  This is one piece of Mormon history that they would largely rather forget and 99.9% of the Mormon membership have no clue that it even happened.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6616302940230534011/comments/default/6811661779177807882'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6616302940230534011/comments/default/6811661779177807882'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/08/briefly-considered-september-11-1857.html?showComment=1216847700000#c6811661779177807882' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/08/briefly-considered-september-11-1857.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6616302940230534011' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6616302940230534011' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="July 23, 2008 at 3:15 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4337229471844750160</id><published>2008-01-07T09:58:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2008-01-07T09:58:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Ezekiel chapter 13Son of man prophesy against the ...</title><content type='html'>Ezekiel chapter 13&lt;BR/&gt;Son of man prophesy against the prophets of Israel who prophesy, and say to those who prophesy out of their own heart, &quot;Hear the word of the Lord!&quot;...&quot;Woe to the foolish prophets, who follow their own spirit and have seen nothing!...They have envisioned futility and false devination, saying &quot;Thus says the Lord! but the Lord has not sent them, ...Therefore...Because you have spoken nonsense and envisioned lies, therefore I am indeed against you...</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6616302940230534011/comments/default/4337229471844750160'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6616302940230534011/comments/default/4337229471844750160'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/08/briefly-considered-september-11-1857.html?showComment=1199725080000#c4337229471844750160' title=''/><author><name>frodofan16</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/08/briefly-considered-september-11-1857.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6616302940230534011' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6616302940230534011' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="January 7, 2008 at 9:58 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8225450971766354423</id><published>2007-09-12T22:57:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2007-09-12T22:57:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>&quot;Brigham Young infecting his followers with war fe...</title><content type='html'>&quot;Brigham Young infecting his followers with war fever&quot;&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Now I think this is a bit of a stretch. You must put things in context. The Mormons had, only a few years before, been driven from state to state, had an extermination order issued against them by the govenor of Missouri, and have been thoroughly persecuted from their founding. They then emigrate to Utah to find peace. At the time of the massacre, the US Army is on its way to Utah, to put down the Mormon rebellion and Parley P Pratt(mormon apostle) is murdered in Arkansas. So you have a persecuted minority who is forced to leave the states, having the US Army breathing down their necks, and a beloved apostle murdered in the east - this all creates an atmosphere of extrodinary tension and paranoia. This in no way excuses the murders at Moutain Meadows, but to say that Brigham Young was infecting his followers with war fever is to me false.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6616302940230534011/comments/default/8225450971766354423'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6616302940230534011/comments/default/8225450971766354423'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/08/briefly-considered-september-11-1857.html?showComment=1189659420000#c8225450971766354423' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/08/briefly-considered-september-11-1857.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6616302940230534011' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6616302940230534011' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 12, 2007 at 10:57 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7368973442805200050</id><published>2007-09-05T00:18:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2007-09-05T00:18:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Isn&#39;t it ironic that, as you say, the Prez knows m...</title><content type='html'>Isn&#39;t it ironic that, as you say, the Prez knows more than us, but that in no way excuses or sanctifies his actions when it comes to the murder and destruction rained down on the innocent.  No matter what &quot;explanations&quot; are offered up they&#39;re nothing more than lies and find their origin in the father of lies.  That they saddle up so cozily to him makes it all too clear where their true allegiance is.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6616302940230534011/comments/default/7368973442805200050'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6616302940230534011/comments/default/7368973442805200050'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/08/briefly-considered-september-11-1857.html?showComment=1188973080000#c7368973442805200050' title=''/><author><name>MOT</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/13996714804361467430</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='29' src='http://www.dailydiktat.com/biohazard.png'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/08/briefly-considered-september-11-1857.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6616302940230534011' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6616302940230534011' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-388975791"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="September 5, 2007 at 12:18 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-662120418326754159</id><published>2007-08-29T19:55:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2007-08-29T19:55:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Given your background, you have done us all a grea...</title><content type='html'>Given your background, you have done us all a great service by reviewing this movie. &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;We are especially thankful that Korrin was able to go with you to the movie! &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;May God bless you and your family.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6616302940230534011/comments/default/662120418326754159'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6616302940230534011/comments/default/662120418326754159'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/08/briefly-considered-september-11-1857.html?showComment=1188438900000#c662120418326754159' title=''/><author><name>Ex-JBS</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/13022405014549557830</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/08/briefly-considered-september-11-1857.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6616302940230534011' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6616302940230534011' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1718797360"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 29, 2007 at 7:55 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2662550544030387969</id><published>2007-08-29T09:22:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2007-08-29T09:22:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Plug Nickel -- As my cinematic analogue might put ...</title><content type='html'>Plug Nickel -- As my cinematic analogue might put it, &quot;D&#39;oh!&quot; &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Thanks....</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6616302940230534011/comments/default/2662550544030387969'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6616302940230534011/comments/default/2662550544030387969'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/08/briefly-considered-september-11-1857.html?showComment=1188400920000#c2662550544030387969' title=''/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='25' height='32' src='http://www.weekendinterviewshow.com/pics/grigg.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/08/briefly-considered-september-11-1857.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6616302940230534011' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6616302940230534011' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1344012943"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="August 29, 2007 at 9:22 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1668496029627482835</id><published>2007-08-28T18:15:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2007-08-28T18:15:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>It&#39;s rather telling that Emma Smith (Joseph Smith ...</title><content type='html'>It&#39;s rather telling that Emma Smith (Joseph Smith Jr&#39;s wife) broke from the church when Brigham Young took over. I was raised in the REORGANIZED Church of Jesus Christ of Latter Day Saints, which was founded by JS Jr&#39;s son once he was an adult. I&#39;m no longer actively involved with that church, but there is a world of difference doctrinally.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6616302940230534011/comments/default/1668496029627482835'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6616302940230534011/comments/default/1668496029627482835'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/08/briefly-considered-september-11-1857.html?showComment=1188346500000#c1668496029627482835' title=''/